npm's packages
==============

apps/desktop/node-shim/npm-config.mjs, npm-spec.mjs, npm-exec.mjs and npm-checks.mjs are ported
from npm's own packages and keep their copyright headers; the desktop app's node shim includes
them. npm-config.mjs reads npm's config as @npmcli/config 10.12.0 and ini 6.0.0 do, npm-spec.mjs
a package spec as npm-package-arg 13.0.2, validate-npm-package-name 7.0.2 and hosted-git-info
9.0.3 do, npm-exec.mjs a package's bins and npm's PATH as npm-normalize-package-bin 5.0.0,
@npmcli/package-json 7.0.5, libnpmexec 10.3.2 and @npmcli/run-script 10.0.4 do, and
npm-checks.mjs a project's devEngines as npm-install-checks 8.0.0 does. Each package's license
follows under its name.

